1619.5.2 Components. The action plan shall, at a minimum, include the following:
1. Threshold of predicted environmental loads;
2. Method of monitoring environmental loads;
3. Name of party responsible for monitoring loads and determining implementation of action plan;
4. Name of party responsible for implementing the action plan;
5. Evacuation procedures;
6. Safety zone, standoff distance or standoff perimeter as appropriate. Safety zone, standoff distance or standoff
perimeter shall not extend beyond the property line;
7. Any other activities, such as the addition or removal of structural and/or nonstructural elements, removal of
loads or creating sacrificial elements so that the structure may resist unreduced forces as required for perma-
nent structures;
8. Plan to prevent wind-born debris; and
9. Verification that the design and procedures shall not adversely impact other structures.
